            text: "Up the far stair at 1700, the fire over my head. Opened valve three again; the canal took the pit. Kral didn't come up.\nGoing over the pass to Kettle. There's a shot-firer there who knows about shelters.\n- T.R.",
            at: (-0.05, 0.6, -0.05),
