            text: "PUMP LOG - O. Brabec, below\n2 Nov. Power off at the board. Not mine. Pumps stopping, the creek coming in at the inlet.\nLet the inlet down first, from the wheel in the side gallery. The screens' wheel is on the inlet's far wall, under its water. The sump has nowhere to go: that's the hand pump, in the screen room.\nMy boots are by my locker. Take them, and the flask.\n- O.B.",
