            name: "Sorter's chit",
            text: "Metal doesn't burn, so it's sorted out first. Bedsteads, prams, a piano's iron frame (down the pit, it was too heavy for the hook), tin toys by the bucket.\nEverything else goes in.\nI kept one back, a clockwork bird. It's in the box. I don't know whose it was. Somebody's.",
